      "text": "Trigger A creature within 60 feet damages Viro\n\n---\nEffect Viro burns the one that hurt them with his gaze. He makes a flaming gaze Strike against the triggering creature. This ranged attack doesn't trigger reactions, and if it's a critical hit, the target also takes 1d8 persistent,fire damage."
