      ],
      "text": "Requirements Viro's last action was a longsword Strike that dealt damage\n\n---\nEffect The sword transforms into a snake and bites at the target of the required Strike. The target takes 2d6 poison damage (DC 24 basic Fortitude save save). On a failure, the target is also racked with terrible pain, becoming Sickened 1 (Sickened 2 on a critical failure)."
